OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft statue to be installed
OL,4,Ain city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 9ft (2.7m) statue of Tomb Raider hero
OL,7,FLara Croft is to be installed in her
OL,8,Fhome city of Derby after a #30,000
OL,9,Ffundraising appeal hit its target.
OL,11,FThe sculpture formed part of the Tomb
OL,12,FRaider: The LIVE Experience in Camden
OL,13,FMarket in London, but has been in
OL,14,Fstorage since the attraction closed in
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FNow the money has been raised to
OL,18,Finstall the fibreglass effigy inside
OL,19,FDerby Market Hall 30 years on from the
OL,20,Frelease of the franchise's first video
OL,21,Fgame.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
