OL,3,GNEWSALara Croft statue to be installed
OL,4,Ain city
OL,5,
OL,6,FCulture and tourism lead councillor
OL,7,FGurikan Kaur said Derby City Council
OL,8,Fwas "thrilled to welcome her home".
